// Dialog :
"P4012841826" "Thanks for taking care of that Outcast bombing, {HeroName}. I have to admit, I was a little worried. It's hard being deep undercover sometimes. All the lying, the dishonesty. You start to wonder whether you're the same person you used to be. But then you help a hero do something good for the world, and you know. You know you're exactly who you wanted to be all along."
// RandomFameString :
"P2511498163" "{HeroName} stopped an Outcast bombing!"

