// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P749690858" "I've got a tip for you, {HeroName}, and it's a doozy. The Outcasts have learned that the Trolls are planning a raid on the abandoned office Lt. Wincott's been using as a base of operations. The unit is made up of trained men, {HeroName}, but they can't stand up to the Trolls in a fair fight. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to rescue those cops from the Trolls.</a> A lot of good men's lives are on the line."
// AcceptString :
"P3429763300" "Rescue the cops from the Trolls"
// SendOffString :
"P3030019018" "I'm counting on you to save those men, {HeroName}. A lot of them are my friends."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3517089197" "Defeat all Trolls in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P957281481" "The police can't hold out against the Trolls forever! You've got to get over to that base!"
// TaskTitle :
"P2145193718" "<color deepskyblue>Flux the  Outcast</color>"

